// Rider offsets for big mounts (read by modules/game_things/things.lua).
// Mount looktype (clientid in the server's data/XML/mounts.xml), then how far the
// seated rider is moved in sprite pixels: "x y", + is right / down, - is left / up.
// Made with the Mount Rider Tuner. Mounts not listed draw exactly as before.
